n class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mul_comm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a₂</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TensorProduct</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tmul_neg</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bracket'_tmul</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">          </span><span class=\"n\">add_neg_cancel</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hy₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hy₂</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">hy₁</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hy₂</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">add_add_add_comm</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">add_zero</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LinearMap</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">add_apply</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">map_add</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">add</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hy₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hy₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">add_add_add_comm</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hy₁</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hy₂</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">add_zero</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LinearMap</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">add_apply</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">map_add</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>For some reason, whereas currently <code>hy₁</code> and <code>hy₂</code> are of the form</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">hy₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">((</span><span class=\"n\">bracket'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y₁</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">((</span><span class=\"n\">bracket'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z₂</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span>\n<span class=\"n\">hy₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">((</span><span class=\"n\">bracket'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y₂</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">((</span><span class=\"n\">bracket'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z₂</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>after the <code>induction</code> replacement they have unprovable preconditions:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">hy₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">((</span><span class=\"n\">bracket'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y₁</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">((</span><span class=\"n\">bracket'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y₁</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">((</span><span class=\"n\">bracket'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z₂</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span>\n<span class=\"n\">hy₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">((</span><span class=\"n\">bracket'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y₂</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">((</span><span class=\"n\">bracket'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y₂</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">((</span><span class=\"n\">bracket'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z₂</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>How do I get rid of the unprovable preconditions while still replacing the <code>refine</code> with <code>induction</code>?</p>\n<p>(For the record, the outermost <code>refine</code> can be replaced with <code>induction</code> just fine.)</p>",
