    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Right, that works:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">private</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bracket_lie_self</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⊗</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⁅</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"bp\">⁆</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">bracket_def</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">induction</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">zero</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">map_zero</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tmul</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">bracket'_tmul</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TensorProduct</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tmul_zero</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lie_self</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">add</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">suffices</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bracket'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bracket'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">map_add</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">map_add</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LinearMap</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">add_apply</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LinearMap</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">add_apply</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h₁</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h₂</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">zero_add</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">add_zero</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">add_comm</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">this</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">clear</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h₂</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">induction</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">zero</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">map_zero</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">add_zero</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LinearMap</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zero_apply</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tmul</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">induction</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">zero</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">map_zero</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">add_zero</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LinearMap</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zero_apply</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tmul</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lie_skew</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l₁</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mul_comm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a₂</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TensorProduct</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tmul_neg</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bracket'_tmul</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">          </span><span class=\"n\">add_neg_cancel</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">add</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hy₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hy₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">hy₁</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hy₂</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">add_add_add_comm</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">add_zero</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LinearMap</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">add_apply</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">map_add</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">add</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hy₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hy₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">add_add_add_comm</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hy₁</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hy₂</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">add_zero</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LinearMap</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">add_apply</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">map_add</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
